{
    "dashboard": {
        "id": null,
        "title": "🔮💎 AI INSIGHTS & TRENDLINE PREDICTIONS - GRAFANA ADVISOR 💎🔮",
        "tags": [
            "ai",
            "predictions",
            "trendlines",
            "advisor"
        ],
        "style": "dark",
        "timezone": "browser",
        "editable": true,
        "time": {
            "from": "now-2h",
            "to": "now+1h"
        },
        "refresh": "1m",
        "panels": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "🤖 GRAFANA ADVISOR AI HEALTH SCORE",
                "type": "gauge",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "avg((up{job=~\".*empire.*\"} * 100) + ((1 - avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:5m])) * 100) + ((container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"} / container_spec_memory_limit_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}) < 0.8) * 100) / 3",
                        "legendFormat": "Empire Health Score"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "min": 0,
                        "max": 100,
                        "unit": "percent",
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 50
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 80
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "blue",
                                    "value": 95
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "mappings": [
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 0,
                                    "to": 30
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "🚨 Critical"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 30,
                                    "to": 60
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "⚠️ Warning"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 60,
                                    "to": 85
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "✅ Healthy"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 85,
                                    "to": 100
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "👑 Legendary"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 2,
                "title": "🎯 AI ANOMALY DETECTION",
                "type": "stat",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "count(abs(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) - avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m])) > 2 * stddev_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "🔍 CPU Anomalies"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "count(abs(rate(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) - avg_over_time(rate(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m])) > 2 * stddev_over_time(rate(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "🧠 Memory Anomalies"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "count(abs(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) - avg_over_time(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m])) > 2 * stddev_over_time(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m]))",
                        "legendFormat": "🌐 Network Anomalies"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 1
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 3
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "mappings": [
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "0": {
                                        "text": "✅ Normal"
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "value"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 1,
                                    "to": 2
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "⚠️ Detected"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 3,
                                    "to": null
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "🚨 Multiple"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 12,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 3,
                "title": "🔮 PREDICTIVE ANALYTICS - 1 HOUR FORECAST",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "📊 Current CPU %"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:1m], 3600) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 Predicted CPU % (+1h)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "holt_winters(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[2h:1m], 0.3, 0.3) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "🌊 Holt-Winters Trend"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "lineWidth": 2,
                            "fillOpacity": 20,
                            "gradientMode": "hue"
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "palette-classic"
                        },
                        "unit": "percent"
                    },
                    "overrides": [
                        {
                            "matcher": {
                                "id": "byRegexp",
                                "options": "Predicted.*"
                            },
                            "properties": [
                                {
                                    "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "dash": [
                                            10,
                                            10
                                        ]
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "color",
                                    "value": {
                                        "mode": "fixed",
                                        "fixedColor": "blue"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "matcher": {
                                "id": "byRegexp",
                                "options": "Holt-Winters.*"
                            },
                            "properties": [
                                {
                                    "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "dash": [
                                            5,
                                            5
                                        ]
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "color",
                                    "value": {
                                        "mode": "fixed",
                                        "fixedColor": "purple"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 9,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 8
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 4,
                "title": "💾 MEMORY GROWTH PREDICTIONS",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"} / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "📈 Current Memory (MB)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[30m], 3600) / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 Predicted Memory (+1h)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "container_spec_memory_limit_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"} / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "🚫 Memory Limit"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "lineWidth": 2,
                            "fillOpacity": 15
                        },
                        "unit": "decbytes"
                    },
                    "overrides": [
                        {
                            "matcher": {
                                "id": "byRegexp",
                                "options": "Predicted.*"
                            },
                            "properties": [
                                {
                                    "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "dash": [
                                            10,
                                            10
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "matcher": {
                                "id": "byRegexp",
                                "options": ".*Limit"
                            },
                            "properties": [
                                {
                                    "id": "color",
                                    "value": {
                                        "mode": "fixed",
                                        "fixedColor": "red"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "dash": [
                                            2,
                                            8
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 17
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 5,
                "title": "🌐 NETWORK TRAFFIC FORECASTING",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "📥 Current RX (KB/s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:1m], 3600) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 Predicted RX (+1h)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "📤 Current TX (KB/s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:1m], 3600) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 Predicted TX (+1h)"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "lineWidth": 2
                        },
                        "unit": "KBs"
                    },
                    "overrides": [
                        {
                            "matcher": {
                                "id": "byRegexp",
                                "options": "Predicted.*"
                            },
                            "properties": [
                                {
                                    "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "dash": [
                                            8,
                                            8
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 12,
                    "y": 17
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 6,
                "title": "🎯 CAPACITY PLANNING RECOMMENDATIONS",
                "type": "table",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m], 86400) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "CPU % (+24h)",
                        "format": "table",
                        "instant": true
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[1h:5m], 86400) / 1024 / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "Memory GB (+24h)",
                        "format": "table",
                        "instant": true
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m], 86400) / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "Network MB/s (+24h)",
                        "format": "table",
                        "instant": true
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "align": "center",
                            "displayMode": "color-background"
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 70
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 90
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 25
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 7,
                "title": "🤖 GRAFANA ADVISOR RECOMMENDATIONS",
                "type": "text",
                "options": {
                    "content": "## 🧠 **AI-POWERED EMPIRE OPTIMIZATION INSIGHTS**\n\n### 🔍 **Current Analysis Results:**\n\n#### 📊 **Performance Insights:**\n- **CPU Efficiency:** Monitor predictive trends to optimize resource allocation\n- **Memory Management:** Track growth patterns for proactive scaling decisions\n- **Network Optimization:** Analyze traffic forecasts for bandwidth planning\n- **Anomaly Detection:** AI identifies unusual patterns requiring investigation\n\n#### 🎯 **Actionable Recommendations:**\n\n1. **🚀 Resource Optimization:**\n   - Scale CPU resources when predictions exceed 80% for sustained periods\n   - Implement memory cleanup when growth trends approach container limits\n   - Consider load balancing when network predictions show sustained growth\n\n2. **⚡ Predictive Scaling:**\n   - Use 1-hour forecasts for immediate scaling decisions\n   - Leverage 24-hour predictions for capacity planning meetings\n   - Monitor Holt-Winters trends for seasonal pattern recognition\n\n3. **🛡️ Proactive Monitoring:**\n   - Set alerts based on prediction thresholds, not just current values\n   - Use anomaly detection to identify potential issues before they impact users\n   - Correlate predictions across metrics for comprehensive health assessment\n\n#### 🔮 **Advanced AI Features:**\n\n- **Machine Learning Models:** Holt-Winters seasonal decomposition for pattern recognition\n- **Linear Prediction:** Simple trend extrapolation for short-term forecasting\n- **Anomaly Detection:** Statistical analysis to identify outliers and unusual behavior\n- **Health Scoring:** Composite metrics combining multiple performance indicators\n\n### 💎 **Empire-Specific Optimizations:**\n\n- **ADHD-Friendly Alerts:** Predictive notifications to prevent hyperfocus disruption\n- **BROski Economy:** Resource efficiency metrics for cost optimization\n- **Legendary Performance:** AI-powered recommendations for maintaining peak efficiency\n\n**🏰👑 Your Empire is operating with AI-enhanced legendary intelligence! 👑🏰**",
                    "mode": "markdown"
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 12,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 33
                }
            }
        ],
        "annotations": {
            "list": [
                {
                    "name": "AI Predictions",
                    "datasource": "prometheus",
                    "enable": true,
                    "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:1m], 3600) > 0.8",
                    "iconColor": "rgba(96, 96, 255, 1)",
                    "titleFormat": "🔮 AI Prediction",
                    "textFormat": "High CPU predicted for {{$labels.name}}"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Anomaly Detection",
                    "datasource": "prometheus",
                    "enable": true,
                    "expr": "abs(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) - avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m])) > 2 * stddev_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m])",
                    "iconColor": "rgba(255, 96, 96, 1)",
                    "titleFormat": "🚨 Anomaly Detected",
                    "textFormat": "Unusual pattern in {{$labels.name}}"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}